      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The grick makes one Beak attack and one Tentacles attack.

      ***Beak.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=To Hit [Beak]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d6+2,dicelabel=Damage [Beak]) Piercing damage.

      ***Tentacles.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=To Hit [Tentacles]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d10+2,dicelabel=Damage [Tentacles]) Slashing damage. If the target is a Medium or smaller creature, it has the ***Grappled*** condition (escape DC 12) from all four tentacles.

